{"full":"hf:happy122431/ImproveAnyTask","spaceId":"happy122431/ImproveAnyTask","name":"ImproveAnyTask","source":"huggingface","description":"Autonomous post-training for iterative self-improvement","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","topics":["static","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":3,"created":"2026-10-06T03:01:37.000Z","updated":"2026-10-06T03:04:27.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://happy122431-improveanytask.static.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/happy122431/ImproveAnyTask","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:38.816Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:38.816Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:38.816Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🔁","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An Autonomous Post-Training Harness for Iterative Model Self-Improvement","ImproveAnyTask autonomously adapts general-purpose language models to target tasks under a limited compute budget. Inspired by gradient-based optimization, it organizes iterative adaptation into three connected modules: Error Attribution, Update Direction, and Executable Model Updates.","Across 11 tasks, ImproveAnyTask achieves mean gains of 18.29 and 11.97 percentage points on Qwen3.5-4B-Base and Qwen3.5-4B-Instruct, respectively, with a maximum gain of 41.96 points, under a 24-hour budget equivalent to eight NVIDIA H20 GPUs."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/happy122431/ImproveAnyTask/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7c9847e302dd76d3e0421ea026236c2647864eedafaed056c40280dc6be6deee","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:38.888Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T20:59:38.888Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An Autonomous Post-Training Harness for Iterative Model Self-Improvement","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/happy122431/ImproveAnyTask/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"7c9847e302dd76d3e0421ea026236c26